<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\ホラーサウンド.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Training... to kill...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is she saying...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be... the curse-killings were... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>, calling it training...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Don't tell me the ones who killed everyone were...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"S-stay back...! Murderer!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I backed against the rock wall and turned on <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> with a <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="にら">glare</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, wait! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> is...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What's that supposed to mean, training to kill!? Training like that means actually killing people!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Did you kill all those people as practice for killing </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s parents!?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm... I'm telling you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...! That's not how it is!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> wouldn't joke at a time like this...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So there's no doubt <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> were made to train to kill people!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Knowing that, <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> had let these curse-killings go on all this time.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, hurry and run! </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">This woman</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s gonna kill you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜.wmv" "281" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "255"}
{MESON "500"}
I fled the secret base.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've got to warn <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> and the others, fast...! <STYLE ID="1">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE> are dangerous!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right now, <STYLE ID="6">Natsumi</STYLE> and the others are with <STYLE ID="2">Kana</STYLE>...!
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
